WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:19.800
Once upon a time, a king and queen longed for a child.

2
00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:24.724
As the years passed, the king tried to be patient.

3
00:00:24.725 --> 00:00:28.164
But he was an impatient man.

4
00:00:28.165 --> 00:00:31.305
"My queen!" he moaned one day.

5
00:00:31.306 --> 00:00:35.766
"We need a child. Other kings have children—lots of children.

6
00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:39.022
Why, I know a king with 12 of them!"

7
00:00:39.023 --> 00:00:47.106
The queen lifted an eyebrow. "Twelve children?"

8
00:00:47.106 --> 00:00:53.798
She patted the king's arm. "Our turn will come. Just be patient."

9
00:00:53.799 --> 00:00:57.581
The king sighed and went outside.

10
00:00:57.582 --> 00:01:03.225
Walking along the palace's lovely lake always made him feel better.

11
00:01:03.226 --> 00:01:05.918
Soon their turn came.

12
00:01:05.919 --> 00:01:13.678
The queen gave birth to a child.

13
00:01:13.679 --> 00:01:18.089
"A beautiful daughter!" the king cried in delight.

14
00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.746
"We'll name her Ellen!"

15
00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:25.486
The new parents began planning the baby's baptism.

16
00:01:25.487 --> 00:01:29.405
The king was in charge of sending out invitations.

17
00:01:29.406 --> 00:01:32.677
He was in such a hurry, he made a mistake.

18
00:01:32.678 --> 00:01:37.162
He forgot to invite his sister, Lady Agnes.

19
00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.629
This might surprise you, reader.

20
00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:43.427
How could the king forget to invite his own sister?

21
00:01:43.428 --> 00:01:46.691
Because he tried never to think of her!

22
00:01:46.692 --> 00:01:51.392
Agnes was a sour, spiteful woman.

23
00:01:51.393 --> 00:01:58.171
In fact, no one liked Agnes, not even her black cat.

24
00:01:58.172 --> 00:02:03.676
She had a huge forehead and a face filled with ugly wrinkles.

25
00:02:03.677 --> 00:02:07.501
When she was mad, her eyes flashed blue.

26
00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:12.960
When she was really mad, they flashed yellow and green.

27
00:02:12.961 --> 00:02:18.833
Oh, and Agnes had a dark secret, which few people knew.

28
00:02:18.834 --> 00:02:27.601
She was a witch—a very wicked witch!

29
00:02:27.602 --> 00:02:34.845
The news about Princess Ellen spread through the kingdom.

30
00:02:34.846 --> 00:02:40.936
"There will be a special baptism at the palace," Agnes said.

31
00:02:40.937 --> 00:02:44.356
"And I will be invited!"

32
00:02:44.357 --> 00:02:48.517
Each day Agnes checked her mail.

33
00:02:48.518 --> 00:02:55.085
Each day she found the same thing—no invitation.

34
00:02:55.086 --> 00:02:58.363
"Grr." Agnes stomped her foot.

35
00:02:58.364 --> 00:03:03.350
"I hope my brother didn't forget about me!"

36
00:03:03.351 --> 00:03:06.716
The day of the baptism finally arrived.

37
00:03:06.717 --> 00:03:11.130
By now Agnes' mind was made up.

38
00:03:11.131 --> 00:03:16.050
"I'll go to the baptism without an invitation!" she said.

39
00:03:16.051 --> 00:03:21.638
She put on her best dress and climbed into a carriage.

40
00:03:21.639 --> 00:03:28.417
As she traveled toward the palace, Agnes' eyes flashed yellow and green.

41
00:03:28.418 --> 00:03:39.954
"Mark my words! My rude brother will never forget about me again!"

